OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan would still be alive with
OL,4,Abetter social care, says family
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of an East Sussex man with
OL,7,Fcomplex physical and mental health
OL,8,Fneeds who died in July believe he would
OL,9,F"100%" be alive if he received better
OL,10,Fcare from the local authority.
OL,12,FChristopher Reader, who died in Bexhill
OL,13,Faged 44, had lived in supported
OL,14,Faccommodation for several years before
OL,15,Fthen living independently, with carers
OL,16,Fmeant to come in three times a week.
OL,18,FBrother Luke Ripley and mum Laura
OL,19,FWalder believe East Sussex County
OL,20,FCouncil (ESCC) neglected Reader, though
OL,21,Fa safeguarding enquiry did not find any
OL,22,Fevidence of neglect.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
